menu "RoboHub BMP180 driver"

config RH_DRV_BMP180
    bool "BMP180 temperature, pressure and altitude sensor"
    select RH_HAL_I2C
    select RH_HAL_SPI
    select RH_HAL_TIMER
    default n
    help
      The Bosch BMP180 temperature, pressure and altitude sensor, reached
      through the common register bus and a timer the selected platform
      implements. An application that sets this gets the driver compiled in; one
      that does not pays for none of it.

endmenu
